{"vid":"UFQ_BI3IRfk","source":"UFQ_BI3IRfk.en.json3","lang":"en","cues":[{"t":0,"txt":"Ever wonder what makes a first"},{"t":1.2,"txt":"impression great, awkward, or totally"},{"t":3.2,"txt":"surprising?"},{"t":3.9,"txt":">> We're breaking down how to make the best"},{"t":5.8,"txt":"impression before, during, and after"},{"t":8.2,"txt":"your job interview so [music] you can"},{"t":9.5,"txt":"stand out for all the right reasons."},{"t":12,"txt":">> I'm Holly, your career co-pilot and"},{"t":13.9,"txt":"professional pal for the day."},{"t":15.2,"txt":">> And I'm Priya. [music] We've got your"},{"t":16.5,"txt":"back as you take on the wild ride of job"},{"t":19,"txt":"hunting."},{"t":19.5,"txt":">> Welcome to Job Search Stories."},{"t":21.9,"txt":">> Let's say the interview's over, back in"},{"t":24,"txt":"my comfy clothes, watching my shows. How"},{"t":27.3,"txt":"do I know if the interview actually went"},{"t":29.7,"txt":"well?"},{"t":30.2,"txt":">> Well, it can kind of be hard to tell,"},{"t":31.7,"txt":"but there are some signs, whether it was"},{"t":34.4,"txt":"a good interview or not so good"},{"t":35.6,"txt":"interview, and sometimes you can tell"},{"t":37.9,"txt":"throughout the interview what signs are"},{"t":39.9,"txt":"coming up for you."},{"t":40.7,"txt":">> All right, Holly, we're going to play a"},{"t":42.2,"txt":"little game right now. You ready?"},{"t":44,"txt":">> Let's do it."},{"t":44.5,"txt":">> It's called good sign, bad sign, and I'm"},{"t":46.8,"txt":"going to list out a bunch of things that"},{"t":48.3,"txt":"could happen during an interview, and"},{"t":50.2,"txt":"you're going to tell me whether it's a"},{"t":51.6,"txt":"good sign or a bad sign. Okay?"},{"t":53.3,"txt":">> enough. Okay."},{"t":54.1,"txt":">> You received positive responses after"},{"t":56.4,"txt":"answering questions."},{"t":57.6,"txt":">> Good sign."},{"t":58.5,"txt":">> I agree."},{"t":59.8,"txt":"Interviewers focused on the negative"},{"t":62.1,"txt":"aspects of the job."},{"t":63.6,"txt":">> That can be a bad sign."},{"t":65.3,"txt":">> Yeah, cuz why are they talking about the"},{"t":67,"txt":"bad parts of the job?"},{"t":67.8,"txt":">> Maybe they're trying to test and see"},{"t":69.4,"txt":"your perspective on it and if you're"},{"t":70.8,"txt":"able to put a positive spin, so that's"},{"t":72.5,"txt":"not necessarily a bad sign, but it could"},{"t":74.2,"txt":"be."},{"t":74.4,"txt":">> You weren't asked follow-up questions."},{"t":77.2,"txt":">> Usually a bad sign, but if you just had"},{"t":79.8,"txt":"a really stellar interview and you"},{"t":81.2,"txt":"answered all of those questions already,"},{"t":82.9,"txt":"then maybe they don't have any more for"},{"t":84.9,"txt":"you. But, typically, there's usually"},{"t":87.3,"txt":"follow-up, so it could go either way."},{"t":89,"txt":">> The interviewer referred to you as part"},{"t":91.2,"txt":"of the team."},{"t":91.8,"txt":">> Oh, that's a very good sign."},{"t":93.1,"txt":">> Yeah,"},{"t":93.7,"txt":">> [music]"},{"t":93.7,"txt":">> even I know that."},{"t":95.4,"txt":"You're asked about your availability."},{"t":97.3,"txt":">> Good sign. Next steps."},{"t":99.6,"txt":">> You felt rushed."},{"t":100.9,"txt":">> Ooh, not a very good sign. Yeah, if"},{"t":102.6,"txt":"they're trying to get you out."},{"t":103.6,"txt":">> Yeah, I agree with you. The interview"},{"t":106,"txt":"length was short."},{"t":107.3,"txt":">> That could go either way. So, it kind of"},{"t":108.9,"txt":"depends. So, if everything was kind of"},{"t":110.6,"txt":"succinct and you answered all of their"},{"t":112.2,"txt":"questions, then sometimes the interview"},{"t":114.6,"txt":"runs a little bit short, or maybe they"},{"t":116.2,"txt":"were just kind of going through the"},{"t":117.6,"txt":"process and trying to get that interview"},{"t":119.7,"txt":"done with."},{"t":120.2,"txt":">> Yeah, I guess that all could depend on"},{"t":121.6,"txt":"the interviewer, too, right? If someone"},{"t":124,"txt":"likes to talk more, it might go longer."},{"t":126.5,"txt":">> definitely."},{"t":127.1,"txt":">> Your interviewer seemed energized."},{"t":129.3,"txt":">> Good sign."},{"t":130.1,"txt":">> The last one I have for you is this."},{"t":132.3,"txt":">> [music]"},{"t":132.3,"txt":">> You were asked about other positions."},{"t":135,"txt":">> That's a good sign. That means that"},{"t":136.1,"txt":"they're interested in you in general."},{"t":138,"txt":">> We got through a lot, but are there any"},{"t":139.8,"txt":"other things that we may have missed"},{"t":141.7,"txt":"that job seekers might experience on an"},{"t":144.7,"txt":"interview that lets them know whether it"},{"t":147,"txt":"was good or bad?"},{"t":147.8,"txt":">> It's very subjective. You can't really"},{"t":149.7,"txt":"know for sure, but like just kind of a"},{"t":151.4,"txt":"general vibe and how you're feeling"},{"t":153.2,"txt":"about it. Did you connect well with the"},{"t":154.8,"txt":"people that you were interviewing with?"},{"t":156.2,"txt":"Did they seem excited about you? Were"},{"t":157.8,"txt":"you showing that you were excited? So,"},{"t":159.4,"txt":"sometimes it's just kind of a gut"},{"t":161,"txt":"feeling of like, yeah, that went really"},{"t":162.9,"txt":"well."},{"t":163.3,"txt":">> Yeah, that feeling like I nailed it."},{"t":165,"txt":">> And even though you may not have"},{"t":166.4,"txt":"answered all of the questions correctly"},{"t":168,"txt":"or the way that you wanted, just overall"},{"t":170.5,"txt":"kind of a general good feeling, that's"},{"t":172.3,"txt":"that's a good sign."},{"t":173,"txt":">> blank and they've already sized you up."},{"t":175.2,"txt":"Search for Indeed on YouTube and make"},{"t":177.1,"txt":"your first impression count. If the"},{"t":179.2,"txt":"interview went well, you're probably"},{"t":180.9,"txt":"breathing a sigh of relief. But"},{"t":182.7,"txt":"sometimes it doesn't go great. Maybe you"},{"t":184.8,"txt":"froze. Maybe they seemed distracted."},{"t":187.5,"txt":"Maybe you accidentally ended the"},{"t":189.2,"txt":"interview by saying, \"Love you. Bye.\""},{"t":192,"txt":"Whatever happened, let's talk about what"},{"t":194,"txt":"you can do next. Holly, so let's talk"},{"t":196.3,"txt":"about that opportunity. What if"},{"t":199.8,"txt":"there's a little hiccup in the interview"},{"t":201.6,"txt":"or it just didn't go as well as we had"},{"t":204.2,"txt":"hoped it would go."},{"t":205.8,"txt":"How do we still give ourselves a"},{"t":207.2,"txt":"fighting chance to maybe get that job?"},{"t":209.2,"txt":">> So, you can follow up. Send a thank you"},{"t":211.2,"txt":"email after the interview and make sure"},{"t":212.8,"txt":"to send it to each person that you were"},{"t":214.8,"txt":"interviewing with and express your"},{"t":216.2,"txt":"interest in the role, how much you"},{"t":217.7,"txt":"enjoyed meeting them and learning more"},{"t":219.2,"txt":"about the company and the position."},{"t":220.9,"txt":"Those things can make a huge difference."},{"t":222.7,"txt":"And also, it's an opportunity to kind of"},{"t":225.2,"txt":"follow up with something that may have"},{"t":227.4,"txt":"not gone so well in the interview. I'll"},{"t":229.2,"txt":"say for myself, I was interviewing for a"},{"t":231.2,"txt":"career coach position and the"},{"t":233.2,"txt":"interviewer had asked me this question"},{"t":234.6,"txt":"and I knew the answer and it was just on"},{"t":236.7,"txt":"the tip of my tongue and I could not for"},{"t":238.7,"txt":"the life of me think of what I wanted to"},{"t":241,"txt":"say. And I remember looking at her face"},{"t":243.2,"txt":"and she was like, \"Uh-huh.\" and like"},{"t":245.3,"txt":"waiting for me to say more and I just"},{"t":246.6,"txt":"couldn't. And so, you know, we moved on"},{"t":248.4,"txt":"and the rest of the interview was fine."},{"t":249.8,"txt":"So, in that follow-up email, I got to"},{"t":252.2,"txt":"say, \"Hey, you asked me this question"},{"t":254.2,"txt":"and this is what I wanted to tell you.\""},{"t":255.9,"txt":"So, I did have that chance to follow up"},{"t":257.6,"txt":"and and feel a little bit better about"},{"t":259.1,"txt":"my answer and"},{"t":261.1,"txt":"I got the job."},{"t":262.6,"txt":">> I love that because it wasn't just a"},{"t":264.3,"txt":"thank you email, it was an opportunity"},{"t":265.9,"txt":"for you to have a little bit of a redo."},{"t":268.3,"txt":">> Absolutely. And it was an opportunity to"},{"t":270.2,"txt":"ask about next steps and when they"},{"t":271.9,"txt":"expect to have a decision made, things"},{"t":273.4,"txt":"of that sort, too."},{"t":274.2,"txt":">> Can a well-written thank you email"},{"t":276,"txt":"actually turn a bad impression into a"},{"t":277.9,"txt":"second chance? I think we actually have"},{"t":280.2,"txt":"a Reddit post about this. Christian, do"},{"t":282.2,"txt":"you have that post?"},{"t":283.4,"txt":">> One Reddit user says that they once"},{"t":285.4,"txt":"hired someone slightly less qualified"},{"t":287.6,"txt":"because their thank you note stood out"},{"t":290,"txt":"and they ended up being a great hire."},{"t":291.9,"txt":">> That's awesome. I mean, so again, kind"},{"t":293.3,"txt":"of goes to show how powerful those"},{"t":294.8,"txt":"follow-ups can be."},{"t":295.6,"txt":">> It's so true."},{"t":296.5,"txt":">> However, though, it doesn't necessarily"},{"t":298.2,"txt":"guarantee that it's going to turn out"},{"t":299.8,"txt":"that way."},{"t":300.4,"txt":">> So then, is asking for feedback after a"},{"t":302.9,"txt":"bad interview helpful? Would the hiring"},{"t":305.5,"txt":"manager potentially interpret that as a"},{"t":307.7,"txt":"positive sign and maybe give you the job"},{"t":310.6,"txt":"and consider you despite the interview?"},{"t":313.2,"txt":"I mean, actually, I think we have"},{"t":315,"txt":"another Reddit post about this."},{"t":316.7,"txt":">> Oh, okay."},{"t":317.2,"txt":">> Okay, Christian, do we have that?"},{"t":318.7,"txt":">> Another Reddit post said where someone"},{"t":320.7,"txt":"got rejected, they asked for feedback"},{"t":322.7,"txt":"and realized that they had the right"},{"t":324,"txt":"skills. They just didn't showcase them"},{"t":326.2,"txt":"well in the interview."},{"t":327.2,"txt":">> But that's a really valuable learning to"},{"t":329.4,"txt":"take away from there. Cuz like a lot of"},{"t":330.9,"txt":"the time, you can't even get feedback."},{"t":332.4,"txt":"So, sending that email, asking for"},{"t":334.6,"txt":"feedback, and taking what you learned"},{"t":336.2,"txt":"with you. So, like, that person probably"},{"t":339,"txt":"is still reliving that and trying to do"},{"t":341.3,"txt":"better in their next interviews."},{"t":343.4,"txt":">> I've gone through the same thing. I got"},{"t":345.1,"txt":"rejected for a job. I asked for feedback"},{"t":347.6,"txt":"and the hiring manager took the time to"},{"t":349.2,"txt":"have a call with me and tell me and it"},{"t":350.8,"txt":"helped me show up better in my future"},{"t":353.1,"txt":"interviews. So, I think that even if it"},{"t":354.7,"txt":"doesn't reverse the job, at least you"},{"t":356.4,"txt":"learn something from it."},{"t":357.5,"txt":">> Again, it seems like it has stuck with"},{"t":358.8,"txt":"you and that's something that you are"},{"t":360.4,"txt":"implementing in other interviews as you"},{"t":362.6,"txt":"go forward."},{"t":363.4,"txt":">> So, I'm a bit biased, but I have to say"},{"t":365.4,"txt":"this has been a really great"},{"t":366.7,"txt":"conversation."},{"t":367.7,"txt":">> It has, yeah."},{"t":368.2,"txt":">> today, Holly. I feel like we've really"},{"t":370.4,"txt":"helped people understand how to make a"},{"t":372.4,"txt":"great first impression, which they're"},{"t":373.7,"txt":"going to get because they're listening"},{"t":375.2,"txt":"to us and taking our advice, aren't"},{"t":377,"txt":"they?"},{"t":377.2,"txt":">> so. But, and also thank you for all of"},{"t":378.8,"txt":"your insight and your stories and asking"},{"t":380.6,"txt":"such thoughtful questions."},{"t":381.8,"txt":">> You're very welcome, Holly. I love"},{"t":383.6,"txt":"working together."},{"t":384.4,"txt":">> Likewise."},{"t":385.9,"txt":"That's our show for today. Thank you so"},{"t":387.7,"txt":"much for watching job search stories."},{"t":389.1,"txt":"[music]"},{"t":389.8,"txt":"If you're looking for more job search"},{"t":391.2,"txt":"advice, be sure to subscribe to Indeed's"},{"t":393.1,"txt":"YouTube channel. Drop a question or"},{"t":395.1,"txt":"topic you'd like us to cover or share"},{"t":397.2,"txt":"your own job search stories and advice"},{"t":399,"txt":"in the comments."},{"t":400.2,"txt":">> Bye."},{"t":400.7,"txt":">> I [music] want to thank you for walking"},{"t":402.6,"txt":"us through how to make a a that that"},{"t":404.9,"txt":"that that that."},{"t":405.6,"txt":">> You're welcome."},{"t":406.4,"txt":">> Before, after, before, during, and"},{"t":409.4,"txt":">> [laughter]"},{"t":410.4,"txt":">> Before, during, and before again."}],"words":[{"t":0,"w":"Ever"},{"t":0.32,"w":"wonder"},{"t":0.56,"w":"what"},{"t":0.68,"w":"makes"},{"t":0.92,"w":"a"},{"t":0.96,"w":"first"},{"t":1.24,"w":"impression"},{"t":1.72,"w":"great,"},{"t":2.24,"w":"awkward,"},{"t":2.76,"w":"or"},{"t":2.88,"w":"totally"},{"t":3.24,"w":"surprising?"},{"t":3.92,"w":">>"},{"t":3.92,"w":"We're"},{"t":4.08,"w":"breaking"},{"t":4.44,"w":"down"},{"t":4.76,"w":"how"},{"t":4.88,"w":"to"},{"t":5,"w":"make"},{"t":5.28,"w":"the"},{"t":5.44,"w":"best"},{"t":5.8,"w":"impression"},{"t":6.36,"w":"before,"},{"t":7.12,"w":"during,"},{"t":7.64,"w":"and"},{"t":7.84,"w":"after"},{"t":8.16,"w":"your"},{"t":8.28,"w":"job"},{"t":8.56,"w":"interview"},{"t":9,"w":"so"},{"t":9.17,"w":"[music]"},{"t":9.2,"w":"you"},{"t":9.36,"w":"can"},{"t":9.52,"w":"stand"},{"t":9.88,"w":"out"},{"t":10.12,"w":"for"},{"t":10.24,"w":"all"},{"t":10.36,"w":"the"},{"t":10.52,"w":"right"},{"t":10.84,"w":"reasons."},{"t":12.04,"w":">>"},{"t":12.04,"w":"I'm"},{"t":12.28,"w":"Holly,"},{"t